{"des":"霜烬平原的怪异调查-文艺系学生普雅雅互动","script":"s_5_6_5","exps":[{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_1"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]怎么样？调查得如何了？普普罗……你怎么跟丢了魂一样？[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普雅雅"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_2"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":0.4,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","transTime":300,"x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_3"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1h","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","x":510,"y":-416,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1h","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]这个嘛……普普罗同学确实遇到了些麻烦……[l]","charaName":"艾薇杜尔"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_4"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1h","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"option","para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_5","text":"（告知调查结果。）"}]}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_5"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[cm][show]哇哦，所有传闻都被证实是假的啊，这也太惨了。[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普雅雅"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_6"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]一番热情前去调查，结果得到了这样的结果。苍天啊！旧神啊！你们为什么要这样折磨我啊！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_7"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]别哭啦别哭啦！这里是本院，周围都是人啦！不就是没调查出东西嘛，不知道的还以为你向我告白失败了！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普雅雅"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_8"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]不只是没调查出东西，我的社团也没了啊～！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_9"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]行了先起来，你一个研究怪异的人趴在地上哭鼻子，比小孩还要丢人。而且谁跟你说调查不出东西就不行了？[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普雅雅"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_10"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]啊？还……还有希望吗？[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_11"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]那当然，这次调查对你们怪异研究社来说是一次失败，但对我们新闻社来说却是一次大成功啊。[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普雅雅"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_12"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]成功？这些调查结果有什么意义吗？所有传闻的真相都无聊透顶，有什么价值啊？[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_13"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]不不不，新闻的逻辑和你们想象的不一样。我们新闻社可不是简单告诉读者真相就完事了。[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普雅雅"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_14"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]骇人听闻的标题、曲折离奇的过程、惊天动地的反转……用这些引发最重要的情绪，才是我们新闻社需要提供给读者的东西！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普雅雅"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_15"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]就凭你们的调查结果，我们瞬间就能想到好几篇新闻，而且必定火爆。听不懂的话，我来给你们举些例子，就拿你们那些传闻来写几篇。[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普雅雅"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_16"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]比如第一个故事，标题可以定为《千年怨气？揭秘旧街深夜哀嚎真相》。调查记者深夜探访时被诡异声响吓得不轻，最终发现竟是附近居民的鼾声！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普雅雅"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_17"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]第二个故事名为《索命凶猫：游荡在冰湖上的死神》。故事讲述一位冰原猎人在荒野遭遇索命凶猫的追杀，最终揭开真相——那些所谓的凶猫痕迹，其实是拯救深渊的红色英雄留下的战斗痕迹！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普雅雅"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_18"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]第三个故事名为《黄金时代的活化石：雪原深处的神秘巨兽》！胆小的记者被脚印吓得魂飞魄散，最终发现竟是芙洛波，这个意外发现定会让读者忍俊不禁～！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普雅雅"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_19"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]最后一个故事名为《全深渊进入备战状态？和平的假象，燃烧军团的阴影》，暗示这是一个未解之谜，激起读者的焦虑心，但据专家推测可能只是熔火元素在此过冬！大家悬着的心放下，完美收场！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普雅雅"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_20"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1f","layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1f","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]这……这些内容也……[l]","charaName":"艾薇杜尔"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_21"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1f","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"option","para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_22","text":"大体说得有些夸张。"},{"tag":"tag_22","text":"有些地方甚至可以称之为撒谎了。"}]}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_22"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[cm][show]措辞或许有些夸张，但读者就爱看这些。给读者想看的内容，应该不算什么大问题吧。[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普雅雅"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_23"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]至于撒谎嘛……这点你可以放心啦。为了营造悬念，小小的谎言也不算什么大错，而且我们最后不是把真相也揭露了嘛。[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普雅雅"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_24"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]比如的确没有记者被吓哭，但你们被真相吓到也是事实啊。只说一半真话的谎言往往比直接撒谎更有力量。怎么样，学到了吗？[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普雅雅"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_25"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]原……原来是这样！学到新东西啦！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_26"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]嘿嘿，跟着我你还能学到更多。那么普普罗同学，合作愉快啦！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普雅雅"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_27"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]这么说……怪异研究社有救啦？太好了！我们的努力没有白费！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_28"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]放心吧，我这就去把稿件肝出来，立刻去找老师～[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普雅雅"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_29"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]等等！社团什么的无所谓，但是你的第二篇报道必须取消，这事关我本人的名誉。[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_30"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]啊？难道你就是索命凶猫吗？[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普雅雅"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_31"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]没错！我就是索命凶猫，我可不想无缘无故背上这样的骂名！[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_32"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]哎呀……反正都要被骂了，不如让我们新闻社帮你增加点人气，说不定到时候还会有人找你合作呢。[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普雅雅"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_33"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]不行就是不行！我对这种恶名才没兴趣，不会继续报道！要是让我在报纸上看到这篇文章，我就找院长投诉你们！[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_34"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]好吧好吧，我们新闻部也是很尊重人的，请放心吧，你们不会看见这篇文章的。[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普雅雅"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_35"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2f","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2f","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]哼，这还差不多！[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_36"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2f","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"fore","img":"bgblack","x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"fore","img":"bgblack","transTime":300,"x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]（最终……怪异研究社总算保住了，那几篇文章也如期登报，引起了强烈反响。关于索命凶猫的报道虽未出现在正式报刊上，但坊间流传的小册子里却记录了不少相关传闻……）[l][cm][hide]","charaName":""}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_37"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2f","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1f","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"